{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 0, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "阿偉，坐陣啦，我啲安排搞到七七八八，心情反而定咗落嚟。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 1, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "係嗰啲……去嗰邊嘅安排呀？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 2, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "嗯，手續有人跟緊，我唔急。急嗰啲人先會亂，我想每一樣都清清楚楚先行。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 3, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "你真係好定，換著我，實瞓唔著。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 4, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_think.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "後生仔，臨記企位企到咁後做咩？眼神唔好死望地下，你望邊，鏡頭就知你諗緊邊。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 5, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_serious.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "記住，冇台詞嗰個，唔代表可以冇反應。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 6, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "", "line": "金鐘創意一間細房，天星音樂個活動完咗，人散得七七八八，鍾楚凝一個人坐喺窗邊，望住樓下啲車。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 7, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "阿偉，坐啦，唔使成日企。企得耐，我睇到都攰。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 8, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "鍾小姐，你今日好似特別靜，唔似平時咁……", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 9, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "我有啲嘢安排緊，安排好，就會靜靜地走一走，去加拿大嗰邊住一排。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 10, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "加拿大？去好耐呀？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 11, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "未定。手續嗰啲，經理人幫我跟緊，我唔想揚，唔想搞到好似開記者會咁。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 12, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_sad.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "我唔係唔捨得香港呢個地方，地方去到邊都係樓同路。我唔捨得嘅，係呢度啲人，同呢度啲戲。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 13, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "你喺呢度拍咗咁多戲，梗係有感情啦。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 14, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "有啲對手，一埋位就知對方想點做，唔使講。嗰種默契，去到第二度，要由頭儲過。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 15, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_serious.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "不過人到咗某個位，就要諗下後面點行。我唔想等到冇得揀嗰陣，先嚟手忙腳亂。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 16, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "你講得好平靜，好似講緊聽日去邊度食飯咁。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 17, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_sad.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "平靜先安排得好嘢㗎。喊苦喊忽，解決唔到手續，仲會俾人寫到亂晒。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 18, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "我想靜靜地嚟，靜靜地走。嚟嗰陣冇人識我，走嗰陣，都唔使驚動咁多人。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 19, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_think.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "（阿偉望住佢，忽然覺得佢唔係高冷，係將好多嘢都收得好埋。）", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 20, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_think.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "……", "choices": ["靜靜聽，唔出聲", "問佢會唔會返嚟"]}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 21, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "鍾小姐，咁你……會唔會返嚟呀？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 22, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "會唔會返，唔係今日答到你。嗰邊住得慣唔慣，呢邊又有冇戲等我，都要到時先知。", "choices": []}
